FreshContext Site — licence terms

This repository holds two different kinds of material, and they are licensed
differently on purpose. Stating that is the point of this file: an unlicensed
public repository defaults to all rights reserved, which is both stricter than
intended for the schema and less clear than it should be for everything else.

